// `area` is the three-character MSC class (keys in `areas`), `msc5` the five-character class. `premises` are only
// the direct premises of the proof named in `proof`. References to other folders carry a prefix ("ent:bezout-identity");
// only the anchor theorems of the other folders are used. `concepts` refers to ./concepts.js (unprefixed) or to the
